{"3504600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ren & Stimpy Happy, Happy, Joy, Joy, Collection", "steam_appid": 3504600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Hello, boys and girls. This is your old pal Stinky Wizzleteats. This is a game about a whale. No! This is a game about being happy! That's right! It's the Happy, Happy, Joy, Joy Collection!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey, man! Ren &amp; Stimpy are back in a collection of games that will satisfy even the sickest little monkeys. Don't be an eediot - add this to your game library today, you filthy swine!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This collection includes the following games:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buckeroo$!</strong> (1993, 8-bit &amp; 16-bit)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space Cadet Adventures</strong> (1992, handheld)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Veediots!</strong> (1993, 8-bit &amp; handheld)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fire Dogs</strong> (1994, 16-bit)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Warp</strong> (1994, 16-bit)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hey kids - s<i>tart jumping up and down like idiots</i>, because look what's new in this collection:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save any where and any time</strong> - this helpful feature will allow you to take a litter box break and return right where you left off!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rewind</strong> - If you're sucked into the hideous vortex of a black hole, don't fear - you can rewind and try again!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Museum Viewer</strong> - Nothing could be more fun than viewing original packaging and manuals for eac